OL,3,GNEWSATown's #200m rebuild fund switches
OL,4,Ato new company                         
OL,6,FControl of a #200m fund to regenerate a
OL,7,Ftown deemed vital to national security 
OL,8,Fhas moved to a limited company owned by
OL,9,Fthe government.                        
OL,11,FThe 10-year plan for Barrow-in-Furness 
OL,12,Fin Cumbria aims to make the town a more
OL,13,Fattractive place to live and support   
OL,14,Fwork on the UK's nuclear-armed         
OL,15,Fsubmarines.                            
OL,17,FIt was previously overseen by "Team    
OL,18,FBarrow", which included the government,
OL,19,FWestmorland and Furness Council and    
OL,20,Fsubmarine builder BAE Systems. All     
OL,21,Fthese will be on the board of its      
OL,22,Freplacement, Barrow Rising Ltd.        
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
