OL,3,GNEWSATown's #200m rebuild fund switches
OL,4,Ato new company                         
OL,6,FThe new company said the change would  
OL,7,Fallow for quicker decision-making and  
OL,8,Fbe attractive to investors, but there  
OL,9,Fwould be "no obligations for meetings  
OL,10,Fto be held in public".                 
